MODIFICATIONS AND EXTENSIONS IN THIS FORK
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
In accordance with Section 5(a) of the GNU General Public License, Version 3,
the following prominent modifications and additions have been made to this work:

1. Canadian & Quebec Localization (2025-2026):
   - Added regional forecast presentation for Quebec and Canadian cities (Montréal,
     Québec, Laval, Gatineau, Longueuil, Sherbrooke, Saguenay, Lévis, Trois-Rivières).
   - Localized bilingual slides, Canadian weather metrics, and Doppler radar coverage.
   - Added Canadian cloud cover and week-ahead presentation slides.

2. Public Safety & Alert Simulation System (2026):
   - Implemented "En Alerte" Quebec emergency alert crawls and test triggers.
   - Created CLI and REST API alert test dispatchers (`alert.js`).
   - Integrated bilingual alert bulletins and warning audio triggers.

3. Linux & Steam Deck Hardware Acceleration (2026):
   - Integrated AMD VAAPI hardware-accelerated video encoding (H.264/HEVC).
   - Implemented optimized display presets for Steam Deck and Linux desktop environments.
   - Added zero-copy DRM KMS screen capture (`kmsgrab`) and PipeWire audio/video capture.

4. Headless IPTV Broadcast Pipeline & Streaming Engine (2026):
   - Engineered headless Chromium IPTV broadcast server (`start-iptv.js`).
   - Added low-latency HLS streaming engine with atomic playlist generation and RAM caching.
   - Added NDI (Network Device Interface) C++ bridge and transcoder pipeline (`scripts/ndi-bridge.cpp`).
   - Added OBS Studio integration with automated HLS and YouTube RTMP stream profiles.

5. Studio Broadcast Editor & Launcher (2026):
   - Visual broadcast configuration editor and preset library (`editor-store.js`).
   - Interactive CLI and Web Launcher interface (`launcher.js`, `launcher-ui.js`).
   - Modernized 2026 graphic asset pipeline with high-resolution vector icons.

